Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A strange being named Gennai asked us to\Ncome to his continent to defeat his enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told us that we have the\Npower to digivolve even more,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.48,0:01:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but not without special tags and\Ncrests that were hidden by Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We built a raft with\Nthe help of some island
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon and T.K.'s Digi-Egg\Nhatched into Poyomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While on the raft, we met Whamon\Nand were swallowed by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:02:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took us to an underwater\Nstore where we found the tags.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all we needed were the\Ncrests, but where to look next?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.54,0:02:15.03,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Etemon! Grand Entrance of Evil
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Etemon, Akunohanamichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We left File Island almost five\Ndays ago. We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.62,0:02:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey i think i see an iceberg\Neither that or it could
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be the continent of server\Nit's server All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everybody. Wake up. Rise and shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're landing at Server.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only resting my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, your eyes were\Nsnoring pretty loudly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're going to\Nbe there in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.98,0:02:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got to make sure we\Nhave everything we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're really there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm ready for land again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:02:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd sure like a bed that didn't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that island's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen an island so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the continent of Server.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, you've just got to\Nwake up and look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to land on a big continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm getting a pedicure. Aw, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Server, here we come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, this is a little too\Nextreme sports for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is there some way i can\Nbe airlifted onto the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,island sorry we can't\Njust move the continent
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for you mimi now according\Nto the map this is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the best beach to come\Nashore just put one foot
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in front of the other\Nand you'll be fine really
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.30,0:03:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's as easy as falling\Noff a log mimi yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well i've fallen off\Nplenty of logs and believe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me it's not as easy as
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i think i broke a nail
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck finding the crest
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are we
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While you were asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whamon told us where to go in\Nthe forest A few miles from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a Koromon village Koromon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, that somehow sounds familiar I was\Na Koromon the day you got here I forgot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Koromon are a group of Digimon Always\Nwilling to help out those in need Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gang, let's move out You gotcha
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is bigger than\NI thought It's simple
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,physics The universe\Nis expanding I think my
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feet are expanding We\Nhave been walking all day
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long And there's no sign\Nof the village yet Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd give anything to be in a nice clean\Nbathtub With lots of bubble bath in it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do that once we get to the village\NYou honestly think they have bathtubs,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:04:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, I smell Koromon over\Nin this direction. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.84,0:05:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.06,0:05:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see a forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.86,0:05:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that where the Koromon village is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.28,0:05:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.28,0:05:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great! Pup dance! We can rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.72,0:05:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even better!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody grab me a rubber duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, where's the shampoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, do you really think\Nthat these are Koromon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are Pagumon.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.96,0:06:03.92,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Pagumon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.96,0:06:03.92,Sign,,360,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Baby
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.96,0:06:03.92,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Lesser Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.96,0:06:03.92,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.96,0:06:03.92,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.96,0:06:03.92,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.96,0:06:03.92,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Bubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, Pagumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are more to them than meets the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Around that corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.28,0:06:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Mimi's hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the price tag. It's Mimi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Mimi's purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She never goes anywhere without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Logically, that could mean only one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Tai! Don't go in there! Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wush, wush, wush, away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you two ever heard the\Nphrase, please, not before entering?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, we're here to rescue you and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe I said don't go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.74,0:07:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hope you never go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay and visit here with us,\Nand please enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is definitely a Pagumon village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong here, Gokimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I smelled was Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet my nose on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.14,0:07:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your poo-poo bladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.54,0:07:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel just like a princess\Nin a big, beautiful palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I once had a chihuahua named Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Tai, you don't suppose\Nthis could be some kind of trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.84,0:07:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I don't know a\Ngood Digimon from a bad one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.78,0:07:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always heard the Pagumon\Nwere awful pranksters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were just hearing an awful rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are really nice\Nlittle Digimon! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.78,0:08:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's Tokomon again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.60,0:08:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The food made him Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we can make me Patamon again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.78,0:08:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want my Digivice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you picking on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.60,0:08:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are so easy to fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of losers. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gazimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, those are Gazimon.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.06,0:09:15.03,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Gazimon
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.06,0:09:15.03,Sign,,360,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Child
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.06,0:09:15.03,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Mammal Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.06,0:09:15.03,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.06,0:09:15.03,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.06,0:09:15.03,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.06,0:09:15.03,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Paralyze Breath
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the evil scale of 1 to 10, 10\Nbeing bad, these Digimon are 12s.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.98,0:09:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did that Tokomon come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this Tokomon came to our\Nvillage with some humans, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are humans here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You eat too much. Get still.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not so special now, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.44,0:09:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're not so special now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of us has to tell Etemon that\Nthe Digidestined humans are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta ask him for time\Noff for a haircut anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:10:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on those kids or Etemon\Nwill make Digizoid out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eggermon, where are you? Etemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till you hear the\Nnews I have for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Etemon? Etemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:10:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.94,0:10:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! The concert sensation of the\NServer continent is back. All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.38,0:11:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's entamon the king there is\Nnothing entertaining about Etemon he
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.32,0:11:26.83,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Etemon
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.32,0:11:26.83,Sign,,360,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.32,0:11:26.83,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Puppet Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.32,0:11:26.83,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.32,0:11:26.83,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.32,0:11:26.83,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.32,0:11:26.83,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Dark Spirits
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.32,0:11:26.83,Sign,,360,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Love Serenade
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has the power to control anything\Nelectronic through his dark network
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone hail entamon the true king\Nnow son you're way too loud for
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.86,0:11:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an early morning time like this\Nunderstand but you were the one using
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the amplifier sir now let's get some\Nstraight sonny boy i'm the monarch
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of rock and roll your jobs make\Nme happy the humans will be here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soon you see now once i start making\Nmy fabulous music well those kids
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.34,0:11:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are gonna be mine they'll just have\Nto come over and see what great
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,star singing like that there's just\None thing wrong huh just that those
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seven kids are already here they've\Nbeen at the park of my village
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since yesterday what just what are\Nyou saying i had it all worked out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kid my whole plan's flawless well\Nsomebody forgot to tell those
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.54,0:12:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans, no it's just a bear I am the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,king here they gotta learn the hard
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way which you already know they\Ncan't be missing with the royal one i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,expect my plans to be followed i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,order you to launch the dark network
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's go wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this won't be your greatest\Nperformance yet boss it's not
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,easy being a superstar a little\Nfunny but someone's gotta do it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.42,0:12:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where are you where could he have gone to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon if you can hear me say something
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:13:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like he's not in the south\Npart of the village He's not in the village
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, can we hurry this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scheduled for a mud pack and a\Nfacial in half an hour Tokomon should
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.96,0:13:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know better than to interrupt your\Nbeauty treatments You're so right Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's being sarcastic. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he's not by the\Nwaterfall Okay, thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.02,0:13:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something is definitely wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My nose always knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.82,0:13:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I smell Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming from behind the waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.28,0:13:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.34,0:13:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, you guys gotta\Nget a bigger apartment,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe someplace with a few more bedrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pagumon came and\Nlocked us in these cages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About three days ago, they came in\Nand took over our whole village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we were really right after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate chatting\Nas much as the next guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you untie me, we\Ncould go warn the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.61,0:14:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have you out in just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't think so. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're Gazimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly right, and we are going to be\Ngiving those humans of yours to King Etemon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're not, not quite. Why don't\Nwe teach the little lizard a lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon's really very small.\NHe can't have gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon's been gone a long time,\NI wonder if he's found anything
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paralyze Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two against one is insane, huh, Bakemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, please help me, Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:15:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, yell if you want, he can't hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.44,0:15:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only it weren't for this waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.76,0:15:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepperbred.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepperbred.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.48,0:15:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepperbred.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do, you dolt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Peppabread!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.12,0:15:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you see, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoke by the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoke? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.38,0:15:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, really, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We looked by the river\Nand didn't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't see a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it is possible that Tokomon arrived\Nafter you Pagumon searched the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, so what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just going to look around\NJust take our word for it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eww! Eww! Eww!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.86,0:16:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Botamon! Why would there be\Na Botamon here? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.78,0:16:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Botamon is the small egg\Nform that digivolves into
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon and then into Agumon\NThen the Pagumon lied to us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to leave here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really hate to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We told you this was our place,\Nnow you know it isn't so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon is our name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.66,0:16:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're clever and we're brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell it's so because\Nwe'd rather run and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never trust anything without feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.76,0:16:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.52,0:16:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready, lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.54,0:16:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, are you all right? Now I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're one of the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolving time, Agumon, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it. Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.56,0:16:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon. Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.52,0:16:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.58,0:16:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon. Digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:17:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolving into the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, Digivolve, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know how serious? Did you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stink!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you like to fight two against one, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.72,0:17:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nooblast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.02,0:17:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon, I thought I lost you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm like a boomerang, I keep coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.50,0:17:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pagumon are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can all return to your village now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.18,0:17:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.82,0:17:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.73,0:17:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A digi-rock star.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You measly little Digidestined\Nhumans, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.23,0:17:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Etemon! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:17:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little bratty kids messed\Nup all my big beautiful plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so now I'm gonna have to punish y 'all by\Na plain little number that I just wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called Wrecking the Whole Place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrecking the Whole Place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think he can actually do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark Network Concert Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, digivolve now! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.30,0:18:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, digivolve to Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.10,0:18:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you say you want a digivolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.45,0:18:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer's no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.46,0:18:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark Network Concert Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark Network, yeah, darling? Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something strange is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Concert Crush took our power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.32,0:18:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does rock and roll have\Nthat effect in your world?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only on our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there's no way for us\Nto fight this monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:18:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.74,0:19:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only we could Digivolve a step further.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A step further?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be what Gennai\Nwas referring to when
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.18,0:19:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he told us about finding\Nthe craft in the tags.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's just a little\Nlate for that now, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.92,0:19:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a safe place where we hide when\Nanything bad happens to our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I know what this is. Okay, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A crest. A crest?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.45,0:19:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we've got a crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.84,0:19:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't this used to be a wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but the crest must\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These mountains are a\Nlong way from our village
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, frequent flyer miles. This\Nplace is the bomb. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.94,0:20:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, with this crest, we\Ncan do anything we want
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.20,0:20:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, guys, I think this is\Nthe first step on our trip home
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Etemon, about the human\Nchildren Yes, little buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trapping them all in that cave is more\Nfun than learning how to lip sync maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not boss they're missing how could you\Nlose them let me see they got away this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bunch is a whole lot more clever than\Ni thought they were i'm gonna have to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.62,0:20:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think about this one then defeating those\Nkids is gonna earn me a standing ovation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.32,0:21:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold and cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to put my hand on my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.46,0:21:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to put my hand on my\Nhand. I'm going to put my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on my
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.78,0:21:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky is bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so hot, that day, that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want a dream to the wind. I put a
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light on the wind. I can't see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other one who appeared in the world,\Nthe one who appeared in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.34,0:22:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world will be a great enemy.
